This plugin follows Obtainium (https://github.com/ImranR98/Obtainium), Copyright Imran Remtulla and
contributors, licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3: how it reads GitHub release lists
(draft and pre-release handling, sorting methods, the names of its settings), its idea of picking the APK
asset by architecture, and the format of its export file. The code in src/ is written for droidtop's plugin
API; where it follows Obtainium's behaviour the comments say so.

Android's binary XML and APK Signing Block layouts are read as documented by the Android Open Source Project
(Apache License, Version 2.0, https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). test/fixtures/enginehost-manifest.axml
is the AndroidManifest.xml of droidtop's Enginehost app, used as a test input.
